# Demo log: feat/sealed-secrets (Bitnami sealed-secrets round-trip)
Date: 2026-05-09T22:23:15Z

## Premise
An encrypted blob is committed to git (gitops/charts/randomquotes/templates/sealed-secret.yaml).
The Bitnami sealed-secrets controller (installed cluster-wide via tofu/k8s-agent/sealed_secrets.tf
as of #19) decrypts it into a regular k8s Secret. The chart mounts that Secret at
/usr/share/nginx/html/secret/api-token; the app fetches and masks-renders it client-side.

